WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.700
Virginia, inspiring his forest army by a personal visit, President Roosevelt makes his first

00:12.700 --> 00:26.680
tour of the Civilian Conservation Corps camps in the Shenandoah Valley.

00:26.680 --> 00:30.840
After inspecting Skyland, the Commander-in-Chief takes a seat at the head of the table to eat

00:30.840 --> 00:36.240
with the boys, and he enjoys every bite of the plain, wholesome food furnished at the

00:36.240 --> 00:37.240
camp.

00:37.240 --> 00:41.520
It's very good to be here at these Virginia CCC camps.

00:41.520 --> 00:45.600
I wish I could see them all over the country, and I hope that all over the country they're

00:45.600 --> 00:49.720
in as fine condition as the camps that I've seen today.

00:49.720 --> 00:53.520
I wish that I could take a couple of months off from the White House and come down here

00:53.520 --> 00:57.880
and live with them, because I know I'd get full of health the way they have.

00:57.880 --> 01:02.040
The only difference is that they've put on an average of about 12 pounds a piece since

01:02.040 --> 01:23.920
they got here, and I'm trying to take off 12 pounds.

